---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="The person behind the engineering.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
    <span class="section-label">// about</span>
    <h1 id="hero-name" class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-display font-bold mt-4 mb-12 leading-tight" style="color: var(--v8-bone); opacity: 0;">
      Kevin M. Ong
    </h1>
    <script is:inline>
      (function () {
        var el = document.getElementById('hero-name');
        if (!el) return;
        var original = el.textContent.trim();
        var chars = 'ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz0123456789@#$%&*';
        var running = false;
        function scramble(delay) {
          if (running) return;
          running = true;
          var letters = original.split('');
          var display = letters.map(function (c) {
            return c === ' ' || c === '.' ? c : chars.charAt(Math.floor(Math.random() * chars.length));
          });
          el.textContent = display.join('');
          el.style.opacity = '1';
          var current = 0;
          function revealNext() {
            if (current >= letters.length) { running = false; return; }
            var i = current;
            current++;
            if (letters[i] === ' ' || letters[i] === '.') {
              setTimeout(revealNext, 40);
              return;
            }
            var flips = 0;
            var timer = setInterval(function () {
              flips++;
              if (flips >= 5) {
                clearInterval(timer);
                display[i] = letters[i];
                el.textContent = display.join('');
              } else {
                display[i] = chars.charAt(Math.floor(Math.random() * chars.length));
                el.textContent = display.join('');
              }
            }, 40);
            setTimeout(revealNext, 50);
          }
          setTimeout(revealNext, delay);
        }
        scramble(400);
        el.addEventListener('mouseenter', function () { scramble(0); });
      })();
    </script>

    <div class="prose max-w-none space-y-6 text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--v8-stone);">
      <p>
        I'm an engineer in San Francisco. McDermott Scholar out of the University of Texas @ Dallas (UTD) by way of the
        Texas Academy of Math and Science at the University of North Texas  (UNT). I started in a clean room building brain probes and I've been building
        things I don't know how to build ever since.
      </p>

      <p>
        I've worked across neuroscience, finance, cybersecurity, experimental hardware,
        and edtech. I've always been more interested in getting better at getting better
        than in any single domain. The scientific method, OODA loops, Buddhism,
        deliberate practice. I'll try anything if there's evidence it works.
      </p>

      <div class="pl-6 py-4 my-4" style="border-left: 3px solid var(--v8-warm);">
        <p class="italic" style="color: var(--v8-bone);">
          Everyone makes mistakes. Whether we put our mistakes to use depends on how
          deeply we reflect on our actions.
        </p>
      </div>

      <p>
        I brew gongfu tea. I listen to Rachmaninoff, Sibelius, and Mahler. I meditate.
        I think about Marcus Aurelius and Tokugawa Ieyasu. I try to get my hoyas to bloom.
      </p>

      <p>
        Princess is my furball daughter who only cares that good code means better wet food.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 pt-8" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--v8-deep);">
      <span class="section-label">// this_site</span>
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mt-4" style="color: var(--v8-stone);">
        Built with Astro. Designed for reading.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
